<title>SPAIN: Spain Tubacex sees 98 net at 4.06 bln pta.</title>
<headline>Spain Tubacex sees 98 net at 4.06 bln pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's steel producer Tubacex told Reuters on Wednesday that it forecasts 1998 net profit at 4.06 billion pesetas.  </p>
<p>Tubacex said a week ago it expected 1997 net profit of 3.5 billion pesetas. It added the following forecasts:</p>
<p>			   1997		   1998</p>
<p>Sales		    26.70		  29.80</p>
<p>Cost of sales	 (21.70)		(24.25)</p>
<p>Depreciation	   (1.25)		 (1.32)</p>
<p>Operating profit	3.75		   4.23</p>
<p>Earnings before tax   3.65		   4.28</p>
<p>Net profit		3.50		   4.06</p>
<p>Net cash flow	   4.75		   5.38</p>
<p>NOTE - In 1996 Tubacex posted net profit of 3.12 billion pesetas, and earnings before tax of 3.257.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
